{"version":1,"content":"<p>與也門胡塞武裝交戰的沙特主導國際聯軍周日（11日）表示，一枚不明飛行物擊中利雅得機場一座客運大樓。</p><p>該機場前一天遭致命襲擊，獲伊朗支持的胡塞武裝被指是襲擊者。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T15:57:58.597422+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":79,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-11T15:36:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T09:57:40.692597+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"4f0661eba0beced7efff21b71a2471e301da7671f4739c05fa47d438c94ac4c3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}